  },
  {
   "v": "max",
   "t": "Я просто ждал тебя здесь.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'I was simply waiting for you here.' Russian says 'waited you', without 'for'. The verb ",
